  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></math> is not differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math><br />For <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ln</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />Also, it is continuous in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and differentiable in <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>. Hence, Rolle&rsquo;s Theorem is applicable.<br />For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>&#8800;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>4</mn></mfenced></math>"
